OL,3,AUkraine strikes Russian data centre
OL,4,Aagain despite Trump warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussian tech giant Yandex has been
OL,7,Fforced to pause its operations at a
OL,8,Fdata centre near Moscow after the
OL,9,Ffacility was damaged in a Ukrainian
OL,10,Fdrone strike - the third attack on
OL,11,FYandex sites this week.
OL,13,FThe company - dubbed "Russia's Google"
OL,14,F- said no one was injured at the centre
OL,15,Fin Vladimir, east of the capital, but
OL,16,Fsome of its services were unavailable
OL,17,Fto users.
OL,19,FEarlier this week, Yandex said it was
OL,20,Fstruggling to maintain its services
OL,21,Fafter two of its five data centres were
OL,22,Fhit in Ukrainian strikes.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
