OL,4,Aagain despite Trump warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FSunday's attack came hours after US
OL,7,FPresident Donald Trump warned that
OL,8,FUkraine should "damn well stop"
OL,9,Fattacking Russia's oil refineries.
